1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:04,960
Across Finland, language, anxiety, distance and missing paperwork

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,360
can put care out of reach,

3
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:11,200
so we're bringing the first conversation into familiar places, closer to home.

4
00:00:11,493 --> 00:00:15,633
Edge Care is a physical iPad kiosk for libraries and community centres.

5
00:00:15,913 --> 00:00:18,713
Walk up and talk to Edi, powered by Gemini.

6
00:00:19,087 --> 00:00:22,477
PATIENT: My voice has been hoarse, and I’ve noticed a small lump in my neck.

7
00:00:23,847 --> 00:00:26,867
EDI · GEMINI: How long have you been experiencing these symptoms?

8
00:00:27,647 --> 00:00:30,527
PATIENT: A few weeks, and swallowing has become uncomfortable.

9
00:00:31,047 --> 00:00:34,307
Edi summarises your symptoms and recommends the next step.

10
00:00:34,547 --> 00:00:40,247
Here, the referral is high priority: speak to a medical professional as soon as possible.

11
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:43,880
An optional voice sample supports clinician review.

12
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:45,860
Never a cancer diagnosis.

13
00:00:46,253 --> 00:00:46,813
Scan a letter.

14
00:00:47,293 --> 00:00:48,513
Add a skin photo.

15
00:00:48,973 --> 00:00:50,353
Leave with clear guidance.

16
00:00:50,813 --> 00:00:56,373
A signature and four digits protect the handoff, designed for single use with Solana.

17
00:00:56,747 --> 00:01:00,927
At the doctor, ElevenLabs turns two languages into one conversation.

18
00:01:01,270 --> 00:01:04,430
DOCTOR · FINNISH: Kuinka kauan sinulla on ollut nielemisvaikeuksia?
How long have you had difficulty swallowing?

19
00:01:06,490 --> 00:01:08,890
SPOKEN TRANSLATION · ENGLISH: How long have you had difficulty swallowing?

20
00:01:09,690 --> 00:01:12,150
PATIENT · ENGLISH: A few weeks. The lump is getting bigger.

21
00:01:14,110 --> 00:01:17,150
SPOKEN TRANSLATION · FINNISH: Muutama viikko. Patti kasvaa isommaksi.
A few weeks. The lump is getting bigger.

22
00:01:17,590 --> 00:01:20,610
DOCTOR · FINNISH: Tutkin kurkkusi ja kaulasi tänään.
I will examine your throat and neck today.

23
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:24,760
SPOKEN TRANSLATION · ENGLISH: I will examine your throat and neck today.

24
00:01:27,913 --> 00:01:30,693
Referrals, visits and follow-up come together.

25
00:01:30,953 --> 00:01:33,553
Public Finnish data reveals access gaps.

26
00:01:35,113 --> 00:01:41,613
In the digital twin, explore how far people travel, where doctor capacity is stretched, and who may need an interpreter.

27
00:01:44,063 --> 00:01:45,023
Test a clinic closure.

28
00:01:46,483 --> 00:01:50,143
Then simulate a mobile clinic, and compare where it could help most.

29
00:01:50,627 --> 00:01:51,127
Edge Care.

30
00:01:51,307 --> 00:01:52,487
An easier first step.

31
00:01:52,747 --> 00:01:54,007
A clearer path to care.
